          "hideComponent": "false",
          "rightMargin": "3",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 10 2020 13:09:36 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h1><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Reclaiming time for care: The future of human-centered workflows in healthcare</span></span></span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Today’s healthcare environment is inundated with devices and systems, often leading to alarm fatigue and increased administrative burdens for nurses.<sup>1,2</sup> This webinar will delve into the challenges faced by nurses, such as excessive documentation and lack of connected devices, and propose a vision for a future where technology empowers nurses to deliver exceptional patient care. Moderators will discuss how they are using advanced workflows and AI-driven solutions to optimize patient monitoring, alarm management and communication between care team members. By leveraging these technologies, healthcare organizations can prioritize human-centered workflows and address the challenges nurses are experiencing today.</span></p>\n<div><p data-slate-node=\"element\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b style=\"font-size: 1.25em;\">Key takeaways:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand the challenges facing nurses in today's healthcare environment.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Explore a vision for the future of nursing, powered by technology.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Discover how human-centered workflows can improve nurse satisfaction and reduce turnover.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 02 2025 20:38:22 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "2",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
